WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.385
Bua ngi yɛ payroll officer lɛni-hu.

2
00:00:02.385 --> 00:00:08.911
Nga ya ti ndɔ salary-ngulu kɛ payment-ngula ɓɛ — pɔtɔ pɔtɔ, a tɛmɛ ɓɛ, na nya ngi Salone tɛ kɔɛ lɔ yila ɓɛ.

3
00:00:08.911 --> 00:00:17.146
Mu nga payroll preview wama, mu ta gross-to-net kpɛtɛi gɔlɔ-hu lɔ, mu payslip-ngula na bank file-ngula lɛvɛ, na mu kɔɛ ɓɛi lɔ yɛpɛi yɛ.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:23.082
Nya ngi payroll pɛɛji ya. Ndɔ-maa na ndɛ sɔti, kɛkɛ ti i preview ma nda i wama.

5
00:00:23.082 --> 00:00:35.866
Preview ya i kpakeninga kɛ wɔtɛɛ-ma gross pay, i NRA progressive PAYE bands lɔ, i NASSIT employee contribution pɛtɛn-lɔɔ mahu lɔ, i loan repayment yɔ-ngula lɔ — kɛ i net pay pɔtɔ ma, kɛ pie i gbia lɔ i ngi wɔ.

6
00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:53.268
Ndɛ preview ya pɔtɔ nda, run button ya i gbia lɔ.

7
00:00:53.268 --> 00:01:06.450
Gɔvment tenant-ngula ɓɛ, SaloneHCM i budget check lɔngɔ ta tɛmɛ ti ma, i payroll cut-off lock ya liɛ, kɛ i run ya li Ministry of Finance approval chain ti ma — ɓɛ ndɛndɛ signature nɔmui kpɛtɛi ta ma nda run ya pia.

8
00:01:07.250 --> 00:01:09.582
Run gbui yila yɛpɛi i history ti njɛi.

9
00:01:09.582 --> 00:01:21.362
Nga ti kpua mu payslip PDF kɛ wɔtɛɛ-ma lɛvɛ, mu payslip SMS ji-ngula gbua hu, kɛ mu bank disbursement file-ngula kɛ Rokel, SLCB, UBA, tɔlɔ Ecobank format ti ma — nya a nya i bank portal lɔ ɓɛ.

10
00:01:23.250 --> 00:01:30.285
Compliance pɛɛji ya i kɔɛ ɓɛi lɔ yɛpɛi nɔngi-maa: ndɔ-maa PAYE returns ngi NRA ɓɛ na NASSIT contribution schedule-ngula.

11
00:01:30.285 --> 00:01:34.623
SaloneHCM i export-ngula kɛ format pɔtɔ ti ma — tɛmɛ sɔti, kɛ, kɛ file ma.

12
00:01:34.623 --> 00:01:37.026
Deadline-ngula lɔngi-ma kɛ pie gbe i tɔɔ.

13
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:44.940
Lɔ numu-ngula: preview ma nda i wama, kɛkɛ ti i budget check kpɔtɔ i teya, kɛ i returns file ma deadline pɛɛ.

14
00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:50.034
Payroll officer quiz ya lɔ Training Center ti ma kɛ i lɛni-hu i ɓɛi certificate ta.
